        <activityName xml:lang="en">Maintenance, electric scooter</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Maintenance, electric scooter
The data reflects the replacement of parts for the maintenance of an e-scooter of 144kg with a LiIo battery pack. Mainly the battery,  plastic and steel parts are replaced. Battery replacement: once. Life expectancy battery: 25'000 km.;
UUID: a10add47-f58a-32ab-a9d0-63d0f24821f3
This data sets includes the maintenance of an electric scooter throughout its life cycle.
Location: Data cover maintenance in Switzerland
Technology: Maintenance of an electric scooter (max. 60-70km/h)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a10add47-f58a-32ab-a9d0-63d0f24821f3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
